{"id":"Cc89b37e95c5dee320eef","zh":"变异系数","en":"coefficients of variation","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","definition_zh":"表征随机参数相对变异程度的统计指标。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"常作为随机分析中设置输入参数相对离散程度的控制量，用于比较轨道刚度等参数的随机性强弱、构造参数演化情景，并考察不同变异程度下的响应分布变化。","translation_note":"本词条含依据文献语境拟定的参考译名。","usage_variants":[{"id":"Cc89b37e95c5dee320eef","zh":"变异系数","en":"coefficients of variation","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","group_id":"H79a2e7040f65c22490c5","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D347e00cbbdc668e84400","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"变异系数"},{"id":"De3954ddaed850e02e7dc","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"coefficients of variation"},{"id":"EM4420a09a1f4e76b4632d7790","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"变异系数"},{"id":"EM5238dc33e3b55597f4321700","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"coefficient of variation"},{"id":"EMe9ad5db882eb6dc619f07f4e","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"coefficients of variation（复数）"},{"id":"EMdefb971219d98d1199004430","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"不额外指定缩写"},{"id":"ED513581dec18767c8ce7f8191","language":"zh","role":"variant","text":"变异系数"},{"id":"ED85ae10cf588507e6f22b6f03","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"coefficient of variation"},{"id":"EDad46ea6df730765d7e1c7d74","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"coefficients of variation（复数）"},{"id":"EDfc9f953e8366eac1724e077a","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"不额外指定缩写"},{"id":"EMe0730f6e43ecc2de8158304f","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"变异系数"},{"id":"EMdd4110df65c262b89920be26","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"coefficients of variation"},{"id":"EDd07caf6767f8816769b3ee31","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"coefficients of variation"}],"sources":{"P001":{"id":"P001","title":"A new model for temporal–spatial stochastic analysis of vehicle–track coupled systems","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2017","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2016.1270456","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 55 (3), 427-448","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-temporal-spatial-stochastic-analysis"},"P113":{"id":"P113","title":"车辆-轨道系统时-空随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.01.012","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-stochastic-model-used-for-temporal-spatial-analysis-of-vehicle-track-coupled-systems"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sde8a55b38ce7d018d4d3","source_id":"P001","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The temporal–spatial stochastic vibrations of the vehicle–track system with different coefficients of variation were studied, in which we assumed that the dynamic parameters obeyed the normal distribution, and the stochastic simulation method of the track random irregularities is probed into.","citations":[{"source_id":"P001","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S293e21a6db4cb3d0c8eb","source_id":"P001","page":18,"page_end":18,"language":"en","text":"The maximum values and reliability degrees of the dynamic indices of the vehicle system, which vary with the coefficients of variation, are listed in Table 1.","citations":[{"source_id":"P001","page":18,"page_end":18}]},{"id":"S51f7c4d9928e8b2ddf51","source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"Finally, an analysis was carried out on the temporal-spatial stochastic vibrations of vehicle-track systems subjected to different coefficients of variation, in which the dynamic parameters were assumed to be subject to normal distribution, and the time-space stochastic simulation of track irregularities was conducted based on measured data.","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S2bf7aec5cbfaac25cbc8","source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"最后,采用该模型分析了不同变异系数下的车辆-轨道系统时-空随机振动,分析中假定系统动力参数服从正态分布,并基于实测数据进行轨道不平顺的时-空随机模拟。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sc7a052f16e37f1df84f6","source_id":"P113","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"由图4可知,无论是轮轨横向力还是轮轨垂向力, 其振动响应范围及概率密度分布散度基本随变异系数的增加而增加。","citations":[{"source_id":"P113","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_concept_id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_zh":"轨道随机不平顺","target_en":"track random irregularities","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb2f3d8a55cf509ac223c","target_concept_id":"Cb2f3d8a55cf509ac223c","target_zh":"轮轨垂向力","target_en":"wheel-rail vertical forces","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C7adf010816ec2b5ee567","target_concept_id":"C7adf010816ec2b5ee567","target_zh":"随机模拟","target_en":"stochastic simulation","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cc1b9575809c573e91cf2","target_concept_id":"Cc1b9575809c573e91cf2","target_zh":"随机振动","target_en":"stochastic vibration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Ca0a49b8a6f951c5891ee","target_concept_id":"Ca0a49b8a6f951c5891ee","target_zh":"正态分布","target_en":"normal distribution","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[{"id":"statistics.measures","label":"概率分布与统计量"}],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P001","title":"A new model for temporal–spatial stochastic analysis of vehicle–track coupled systems","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2017","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2016.1270456","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 55 (3), 427-448","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-temporal-spatial-stochastic-analysis"},{"id":"P113","title":"车辆-轨道系统时-空随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.01.012","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-stochastic-model-used-for-temporal-spatial-analysis-of-vehicle-track-coupled-systems"}]}